WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.950
Gametes carry half the chromosomes, so fertilisation restores the full number.

2
00:00:06.076 --> 00:00:09.626
A sperm and an egg: each carries half the chromosomes.

3
00:00:12.727 --> 00:00:16.327
The midpiece is packed with mitochondria to power the tail.

4
00:00:17.256 --> 00:00:21.581
Twenty three from each gamete make forty six in the fertilised egg.
